"\n"
"Enable by opening the radiation pattern window."
msgstr ""
"Animatsiya paytida yaqin magnit maydoni vektorlarini koʻrsatish.\n"
"\n"
"Nurlanish diagrammasi oynasini ochib faollashtiring."

#: resources/animate.glade:1204
