"the mathlib implementation to parallelize the linear algebra calculation of "
"one job.  Each job receives an equal share of the processors as its thread "
"count, and the --threads N option states a count of its own instead.  An "
"exported thread-count variable states the count itself and overrides both; "
"xnec2c names that variable at startup and refuses --threads while one is "
"set.\n"
"\n"
"Each benchmark specifies a complexity to indicate approximately how long it "
"will take to run.  For example, O(N) means the time will scale with N and "
"O(N*J) means it will scale with N*J:\n"
"  * N is the number of mathlibs selected here:\n"
"      File->Mathlib Benchmarks->Selected Mathlibs\n"
"  * J is the number of jobs specified on the command line with -j (eg, -j "
"8)\n"
"  * T is the number of threads one job gives the linear algebra library\n"
"\n"
"Higher complexity options run more benchmarks to provide additional "
"information about how you might optimize your xnec2c runtime.  The benchmark "
"menu options are as follows:  \n"
"\n"
"* Parallel (-j N): O(N/J) time: Benchmark each mathlib in parallel with the "
"number of jobs specified on the command line with -j.\n"
"\n"
"* Single Job (-j 1): O(N) time: Benchmark each mathlib with a single job "
"even if -j was specified on the command line. This is useful to find the "
"fastest interactive mathlib that is used when the frequency is changed in "
"the UI by changing a Frequency MHz +/- widget or (right-)clicking on the "
"frequency plot\n"
"\n"
"* Iterate -j N/=2: O(N*log2(J)) time: Benchmark each mathlib in parallel "
"initially with the number of jobs specified on the command line with -j, and "
"then reduce the number jobs by half for each subsequent iteration until only "
"one job remains.  This is useful to find a balance between the number of "
"parallel jobs specified by -j and the number of threads used by the linear "
"algebra library as modified by the environment variables listed above.\n"
"\n"
"* Iterate -j N-=2: O(N*J) time: Same as -j N/=2 above, but instead decrement "
"the number of jobs by 1.  This takes the longest to run.\n"
"\n"
"* Threads (-j 1, --threads N/=2): O(N*log2(T)) time: Benchmark each mathlib "
"with a single job, starting with every processor given to the linear algebra "
"library and halving the thread count for each subsequent iteration until one "
"thread remains.  This finds the thread count beyond which one matrix solve "
"stops gaining, which is the count that matters when a sweep has fewer "
"frequencies left to compute than you have processors.\n"
msgstr ""
"xnec2c ishlarni fork qiladi va parallel bajaradi, tola esa mathlib amalga "
"oshirishida bitta ishning chiziqli algebra hisobini parallellashtirish uchun "
"ishlatiladi.  Har bir ish protsessorlarning teng ulushini oʻzining tola soni "
"sifatida oladi, buning oʻrniga --threads N opsiyasi oʻz sonini belgilaydi.  "
"Eksport qilingan tola soni oʻzgaruvchisi sonning oʻzini belgilaydi va "
"ikkalasini ham ustunlik bilan almashtiradi; xnec2c ishga tushganda bu "
"oʻzgaruvchini nomlaydi va biri oʻrnatilganida --threads ni rad etadi.\n"
"\n"
"Har bir sinov uni bajarish uchun taxminan qancha vaqt ketishini koʻrsatish "
"maqsadida murakkablikni belgilaydi.  Masalan, O(N) vaqt N bilan "
"masshtablanishini, O(N*J) esa N*J bilan masshtablanishini anglatadi:\n"
"  * N bu yerda tanlangan mathliblar soni:\n"
"      File->Mathlib Benchmarks->Selected Mathlibs\n"
"  * J buyruq satrida -j bilan belgilangan ishlar soni (masalan, -j 8)\n"
"  * T bitta ish chiziqli algebra kutubxonasiga beradigan tolalar soni\n"
"\n"
"Yuqoriroq murakkablikdagi opsiyalar xnec2c ish vaqtini qanday "
"optimallashtirishingiz haqida qoʻshimcha maʼlumot berish uchun koʻproq "
"sinovlarni bajaradi.  Sinov menyusi opsiyalari quyidagicha:  \n"
"\n"
"* Parallel (-j N): O(N/J) vaqt: Har bir mathlibni buyruq satrida -j bilan "
"belgilangan ishlar sonida parallel sinang.\n"
"\n"
"* Bitta ish (-j 1): O(N) vaqt: Buyruq satrida -j belgilangan boʻlsa ham, har "
"bir mathlibni bitta ish bilan sinang. Bu foydalanuvchi interfeysida chastota "
"Frequency MHz +/- vidjeti oʻzgartirilganda yoki chastota chizmasi ustiga "
"(oʻng tugma bilan) bosilganda ishlatiladigan eng tezkor interaktiv mathlibni "
"topish uchun foydalidir\n"
"\n"
"* -j N/=2 iteratsiyasi: O(N*log2(J)) vaqt: Dastlab har bir mathlibni buyruq "
"satrida -j bilan belgilangan ishlar sonida parallel sinang, soʻng faqat "
"bitta ish qolgunga qadar har keyingi iteratsiyada ishlar sonini yarmiga "
"kamaytiring.  Bu -j bilan belgilangan parallel ishlar soni va yuqorida "
"keltirilgan muhit oʻzgaruvchilari bilan oʻzgartiriladigan chiziqli algebra "
"kutubxonasi ishlatadigan tolalar soni oʻrtasidagi muvozanatni topish uchun "
"foydalidir.\n"
"\n"
"* -j N-=2 iteratsiyasi: O(N*J) vaqt: Yuqoridagi -j N/=2 bilan bir xil, biroq "
"buning oʻrniga ishlar sonini 1 taga kamaytiradi.  Buni bajarish eng uzoq "
"davom etadi.\n"
"\n"
"* Tolalar (-j 1, --threads N/=2): O(N*log2(T)) vaqt: Har bir mathlibni bitta "
"ish bilan sinang, dastlab barcha protsessorlarni chiziqli algebra "
"kutubxonasiga berib, soʻng faqat bitta tola qolgunga qadar har keyingi "
"iteratsiyada tola sonini yarmiga kamaytiring.  Bu bitta matritsa yechimi "
"kuchaytirishni toʻxtatadigan tola sonini topadi, bu esa tarashda hisoblash "
"uchun protsessorlaringiz sonidan kam chastota qolganda ahamiyatli sondir.\n"

